    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "20 Famous Places to Visit in Korea :",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A Homemade Piece of History: The Korean Folk Village in Suwon",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "찾아볼 만한 매우 흥미로운 한 장소는 서울에서 멀지않은 경기도 수원시 가까이 위치한 한국민속촌이 있습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "One very interesting place to visit is the Korean Folk Village located near the city of Suwon in Gyunggi Province, not far from the capital of Seoul.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "그곳을 찾아가면, 전통 결혼식, 전통 음식 맛, 그리고 옛날 한국 사람들이 어떻게 살았는지 확인 할 수 있습니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "When you visit there, you can witness a traditional wedding ceremony, taste a variety of traditional foods, and you can observe how Koreans lived during ancient times.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "그것은 많은 외국 방문객들에게 인기 있고 매력적인 것입니다.",
      "lang": "ko"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It is a very popular attraction for many foreign visitors.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "One very interesting place to visit is the Korean Folk Village locatednear the city of Suwon in Gyunggi Province, not far from the capital of Seoul.",
      "lang": "en"
    }
  ],
